{
  "_doc": "logical name → {kind, paths}. paths are globs, relative to VOXWEFT_MODEL_DIR unless absolute; first hit wins. Override any entry with VOXWEFT_MODEL_<NAME>. The two hub-cache layouts (HF snapshots/*, ModelScope owner/name) are both listed so either download route works.",

